---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Equipo Administrativo y Programas — Fundación Compasyon" description="Equipo Administrativo y Programas — Fundación Compasyon / Fundafil - Pas" activeNav="nosotros">
<main>

    <!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════
         HERO: EQUIPO ADMINISTRATIVO Y PROGRAMAS
    ════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
    <section class="page-hero" style="background-image: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(20, 20, 20, 0) 30%, rgba(20, 20, 20, 0.92) 100%), url('/assets/team_administrativo.png');" aria-label="Portada Equipo Administrativo y Programas">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="page-hero__content" data-reveal>
          <h1 class="page-hero__title">Equipo Administrativo y Programas</h1>
          <p class="page-hero__subtitle">
            Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet consectetur. Risus nunc malesuada dictum netus urna in. Varius fermentum non egestas leo massa mi habitant interdum ac.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════
         EQUIPO ADMINISTRATIVO (2 MIEMBROS)
    ════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
    <section class="team-page-section" aria-label="Equipo Administrativo">
      <div class="container">
        <h2 class="team-section-heading" data-reveal>Equipo Administrativo</h2>

        <div class="member-cards-grid--centered">
          <div class="member-card" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="1">
            <div class="member-card__avatar">
              <img src="/assets/members/adm_1.jpg" alt="Nombre Apellido">
            </div>
            <h3 class="member-card__name">Nombre Apellido</h3>
            <span class="member-card__role">Nombre Apellido</span>
            <p class="member-card__desc">
              Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet consectetur. In magna suspendisse nec facilisis egestas tellus ac. Cras a sodales suspendisse dictum. Tincidunt diam aliquet neque purus. Morbi risus sed egestas aliquet lobortis aliquam est. Urna aliquam tortor vitae mattis vestibulum. Ut auctor cursus fdflgg vdfdf.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="member-card" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="2">
            <div class="member-card__avatar">
              <img src="/assets/members/adm_2.jpg" alt="Nombre Apellido">
            </div>
            <h3 class="member-card__name">Nombre Apellido</h3>
            <span class="member-card__role">Nombre Apellido</span>
            <p class="member-card__desc">
              Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet consectetur. In magna suspendisse nec facilisis egestas tellus ac. Cras a sodales suspendisse dictum. Tincidunt diam aliquet neque purus. Morbi risus sed egestas aliquet lobortis aliquam est. Urna aliquam tortor vitae mattis vestibulum. Ut auctor cursus fdflgg vdfdf.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════
         EQUIPO DE PROGRAMAS (1 MIEMBRO)
    ════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
    <section class="team-page-section" style="padding-top: 10px;" aria-label="Equipo de Programas">
      <div class="container">
        <h2 class="team-section-heading" data-reveal>Equipo de Programas</h2>

        <div class="member-cards-grid--centered">
          <div class="member-card" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="1">
            <div class="member-card__avatar">
              <img src="/assets/members/adm_3.jpg" alt="Nombre Apellido">
            </div>
            <h3 class="member-card__name">Nombre Apellido</h3>
            <span class="member-card__role">Nombre Apellido</span>
            <p class="member-card__desc">
              Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet consectetur. In magna suspendisse nec facilisis egestas tellus ac. Cras a sodales suspendisse dictum. Tincidunt diam aliquet neque purus. Morbi risus sed egestas aliquet lobortis aliquam est. Urna aliquam tortor vitae mattis vestibulum. Ut auctor cursus fdflgg vdfdf.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════
         OTRAS ÁREAS
    ════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
    <section class="other-areas-section" aria-label="Otras Áreas">
      <div class="container">
        <h2 class="other-areas-heading" data-reveal>Otras Áreas</h2>

        <div class="other-areas-grid">
          <!-- Directorio -->
          <div class="other-area-card" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="1">
            <div class="other-area-card__thumb" style="background-image: url('/assets/team_directorio.png');"></div>
            <div class="other-area-card__body">
              <h3 class="other-area-card__title">Directorio</h3>
              <p class="other-area-card__desc">Lorem ipsum dolor sit ametvidd consectetur.</p>
              <a href="/equipo-directorio" class="other-area-card__btn">Ver más</a>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Juventud -->
          <div class="other-area-card" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="2">
            <div class="other-area-card__thumb" style="background-image: url('/assets/team_juventud.png');"></div>
            <div class="other-area-card__body">
              <h3 class="other-area-card__title">Juventud</h3>
              <p class="other-area-card__desc">Lorem ipsum dolor sit ametvidd consectetur.</p>
              <a href="/equipo-juventud" class="other-area-card__btn">Ver más</a>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Base Hogar -->
          <div class="other-area-card" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="3">
            <div class="other-area-card__thumb" style="background-image: url('/assets/team_base_hogar.png');"></div>
            <div class="other-area-card__body">
              <h3 class="other-area-card__title">Base Hogar</h3>
              <p class="other-area-card__desc">Lorem ipsum dolor sit ametvidd consectetur.</p>
              <a href="/equipo-base-hogar" class="other-area-card__btn">Ver más</a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

  </main>
</Layout>
